Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:18.04,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.08,Music,,0,0,0,,Life is harder than i like to think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:31.43,Music,,0,0,0,,But it's easy when you're by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:34.88,Music,,0,0,0,,No point in calling you'll just have to see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.99,Music,,0,0,0,,The fundamentals of our life tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:41.42,Music,,0,0,0,,Cause I've been looking at a photograph of you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:44.99,Music,,0,0,0,,And I've been thinking about all the ways you move
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.99,0:00:49.77,Music,,0,0,0,,This isolation got me feeling like a move my love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:56.07,Music,,0,0,0,,Yeah when I wake up I feel empty not beside you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:59.27,Music,,0,0,0,,My whole life been searching just to find you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:06.78,Music,,0,0,0,,This quarantine it hasn't got the right to keep us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:13.83,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No riding your skateboard in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last time I'm going to tell you Sleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.64,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. You got it Mr Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late again Sleet, next time it's a write up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:32.66,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the heads up teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:35.31,Sleet,,0,0,0,,William, get out of my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.95,0:01:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your seat? Ahaha, last I checked it didn't belong to you anymore snot bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:42.27,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is the first day of the second semester.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I let the students choose where they want to sit for the rest of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the perks of getting here on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:54.33,Sleet,,0,0,0,,But this is my seat, and the best seat in the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:56.59,Sleet,,0,0,0,,It's the one closest to the pencil sharpener.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:02:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Correction. It was your seat once faggot, but it's mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:03.68,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Okay, well where am I supposed to sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:05.35,Sleet,,0,0,0,,There aren't any more open seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, there's one far in the back. Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:14.88,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Teacher you can't do this to me, I can't sit over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:18.33,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Because that's, that's Dingo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:22.69,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Everybody hates Dingo. He always smells like Bush's baked beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:25.93,Sleet,,0,0,0,,And he pooped his pants during social studies last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:30.54,Sleet,,0,0,0,,He always stands by the vending machine, to try and steal people's candy bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey James, you want a fucking candy bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I could go for a snickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, did you say you wanted a snickers or a milky way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:49.88,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Give me that bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go, this is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:53.43,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I'll fucking rape you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[Screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:59.51,Sleet,,0,0,0,,If I have to sit next to Dingo I'll be a laughingstock for the rest of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have thoughts about that before coming to class late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go take your seat before I write you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:11.37,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Hi, what's your name? My name is Dingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:14.21,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had your seat stolen from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:17.93,Dingo,,0,0,0,,But you really should have gotten here earlier if you wanted to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.95,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me until lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:27.03,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Are you a planetary exchange student too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:29.27,Dingo,,0,0,0,,You look different from the other students.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.20,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Are you also from Mobius?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:37.24,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I heard a lot of other Mobians signed up for the planetary exchange student program to come to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:41.70,Dingo,,0,0,0,,But I never dreamed any of them would have also chosen to come to this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:45.60,Dingo,,0,0,0,,That's so cool. Hey, can you teach me how to skateboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:49.02,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Can you skate anywhere you want on that fine piece of ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:53.25,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Like McDonald's or to the store to buy a can of Bush's baked beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:57.08,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Has anybody ever told you you got a fat fucking dumptruck ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:01.67,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I mean shit, bitch. You could fit a lawnmower in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:03.79,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Why are you still talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:07.01,Dingo,,0,0,0,,You said I could talk to you after lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:10.85,Sleet,,0,0,0,,I did? Did I really say that? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, William... Why's Sleet still hanging out with Dingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but watch this Oliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, William. First you steal his seat in math class, now you're going to break his stupid long nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy today. I haven't seen you like this since you tried to rape the PE teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost makes me want to kiss you... and I would if you would let me... Just kidding I'm not gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr Wilson had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Sleet. Sleet's a Mobian, and Mobian's have no place on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,William... Are you racist?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just basic nature. The weak should always fear the strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am the strongest man in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I never told anyone this Oliver,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have to keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not really a 16 year old boy like the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually a 36 year old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:04.42,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.74,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're throwing this thing bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:10.32,Dingo,,0,0,0,,You could have seriously hurt my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:19.33,Music,,0,0,0,,[Music]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:24.69,Sleet,,0,0,0,,[Farting]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:28.45,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Shit! I think I just pooped my fucking pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:29.90,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:31.17,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Take me to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:41.88,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Oh hey William. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:44.78,Sleet,,0,0,0,,I thought you always poop at exactly 5am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:47.23,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Isn't it only two in the afternoon right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.82,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Wait, I thought you always poop alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:50.89,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and my buddy Oliver here saw that you became quick friends with Dingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:59.99,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Dingo's not my friend. I just have to sit next to him during class now. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were eating together at lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And he saved you from being knocked out by that ball during gym class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:11.05,Sleet,,0,0,0,,He's the one following me around. I've been trying to get him off my back all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.16,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Why does Oliver there have a baseball bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it now Sleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You used to be one of the cool kids like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you started hanging out with Dingo, that title of yours is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty much on the level of a bitch now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:30.87,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What? No, I'm still one of the cool kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.54,Sleet,,0,0,0,,I'm way cooler than you are William.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:34.67,Sleet,,0,0,0,,And how the fuck is Oliver a cool kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:36.98,Sleet,,0,0,0,,He just moved here from France two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:40.28,Sleet,,0,0,0,,And he pooped his pants in social studies on his first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... And that's what makes me cool... Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:53.22,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to make me ask where this clown came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:55.25,Sleet,,0,0,0,,There's no way he goes to this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:57.27,Sleet,,0,0,0,,He's got to be 30 years old at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:07:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my older brother Dominic, or as he likes to be called: Doodoo the clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I call myself Doodoo because after I kill someone, I take a massive fucking doodoo in their mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,During the day he works during the day he works as a teacher's assistant over at the elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But at night he's an assassin who hunts down and kills anybody I want gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He was nice enough to come out during the day, though just for this occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:25.52,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Okay, but why is he dressed like a clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:26.96,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Is it some weird fetish shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I really need to get back to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I hear the teacher calling for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the rush cutie? Don't you wanna have a little fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to break his legs big bro, that way he can't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And Oliver, go pull down has fucking pants. I want to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch! I was going to go easy on you! You're going to regret that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved by the bell. You are lucky i have a math test to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over Sleet. We'll be meeting you after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.31,0:08:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And make sure to bring that faggot Dingo with you so we can make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on boys, let's make like a bunch of bananas and peel out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:45.20,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Sleet, how was your pee break you didn't miss the toilet did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:46.59,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I do that a lot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:49.01,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:03.23,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Shit, what am I gonna do? William is a black belt in karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:04.84,Sleet,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:08.83,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Especially if Oliver and his big brother Doodoo are also going to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:13.00,Sleet,,0,0,0,,But I can't just back out from a fight, then I really will be a total bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.92,Sleet,,0,0,0,,I won't be the coolest kid in school anymore either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.64,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Sleet, can i tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.14,Sleet,,0,0,0,,I just said don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:23.80,Dingo,,0,0,0,,But it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:25.95,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Fine, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:28.15,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Promise not to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.11,Sleet,,0,0,0,,I can't promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:35.10,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say thank you for being my first friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:38.62,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:43.58,Dingo,,0,0,0,,You know the two of us are different from everyone else in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:47.76,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Everybody here are earthlings, so they find us to be a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.93,0:09:52.55,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I've been here for half a year already, and in that time I never made a single friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:57.07,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I was beginning to think it would never happen, but then one day you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:58.72,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I think I was really lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:03.78,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. That's pretty cool I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:12.22,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Do you want to hang out at my place after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:30.81,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Um, actually Dingo I think I hear the teacher calling my name. You can go without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:34.74,Dingo,,0,0,0,,You got it sugar tits. Don't keep me waiting too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here you big fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.33,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Those guys have got to be gone by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:33.15,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:38.94,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you to be finished. Did you do what the teacher wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.29,0:11:40.64,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:55.26,Sleet,,0,0,0,,This is my first time visiting another person's house on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:12:02.53,Sleet,,0,0,0,,Although Dingo is another Mobian like me, so I guess it doesn't really count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:06.64,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Have you taken an interest in my beanie baby collection?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:09.70,Sleet,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you wearing all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.10,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Whatever do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:15.06,Dingo,,0,0,0,,I told you I was going to slip into something more comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:18.71,Sleet,,0,0,0,,No you didn't, you told me you were going to take a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.19,Dingo,,0,0,0,,Are you thirsty Sleet?
